              that was obtained via SSEECCCCOOMMPP__IIOOCCTTLL__NNOOTTIIFF__RREECCVV.

       _f_l_a_g_s  This field is a bit mask of flags that modify  the  behavior  of
              the operation.  Currently, only one flag is supported:

              SSEECCCCOOMMPP__AADDDDFFDD__FFLLAAGG__SSEETTFFDD
